<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the semifinals of the Dunhill Cup soccer tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>    China   3    Zimbabwe 1 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - San Zhi Yi 22, 58</p>
<p>		Li Ming 29</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Morgan Nkathazo 88</p>
<p>    Bosnia   1   Malaysia 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Asim Hrnjic 35</p>
